# Flutter conventions

`apps/mobile` is the iOS and Android app. `apps/admin` is the Flutter web admin app. Keep them separate.

- Route with `go_router`.
- Read `APP_ENV` and `API_BASE_URL` from `--dart-define` via `AppConfig`.
- Keep English (`en`) and Simplified Chinese (`zh`) ARB files in `lib/l10n`.
- Generate localizations from `l10n.yaml`. Do not hardcode user-facing strings in widgets.
- Leave campaign and administration workflows out of the shells until a later phase adds them.

```sh
flutter run --dart-define=APP_ENV=development --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
```
